# Test an agent locally

From `/workspace/openbot`, start the development runtime in the background:

```bash
NO_DESKTOP=1 pnpm openbot dev
```

This serves every authored agent from this checkout and registers each one
with Tilde through the local-runtime tunnel (`local_running_endpoint`), so the
owner can immediately chat with the agent from the workspace UI while it still
runs locally. Wait for `Tilde local-runtime tunnel: connected` in the log
before telling the owner the agent is ready.

Keep the process running while the owner tests. Apply requested changes to the
agent's files under `configuration/agent/subagents/<id>/`; the development
runtime reloads them. Stop the process only after the agent is deployed or the
owner is done testing.
